Done. Here's what I shipped:

**/outline now accepts file paths** — running /outline src/main.rs shows all symbols in that file sorted by line number, instead of the old behavior of treating it as a failed symbol-name search.

What changed:
• src/commands_search.rs: Added looks_like_file_path() (checks for / or known code extensions) and `collect_file_outline()` (filters repo map to one file, sorts by line). Modified handle_outline() to try file-path mode first when the query looks like a path and the file exists on disk, falling through to symbol search otherwise.
• src/help.rs: Updated all four help surfaces (detailed /help outline, REPL help, CLI subcommand help, short description) to reflect the new `<query|filepath>` syntax.
• 5 new tests: `looks_like_file_path_with_slash, looks_like_file_path_with_known_extension, looks_like_file_path_rejects_symbol_names, collect_file_outline_filters_by_path, collect_file_outline_sorts_by_line`.

